N2(v4) + N2 => N2(v3) + N2                !  kVT10_N2N2*4.075*exp(6.384d0/Tgas**(1.0d0/3.0d0))
N2(v5) + N2 => N2(v4) + N2                !  kVT10_N2N2*5.125*exp(8.512d0/Tgas**(1.0d0/3.0d0))
N2(v6) + N2 => N2(v5) + N2                !  kVT10_N2N2*6.189*exp(10.64d0/Tgas**(1.0d0/3.0d0))
N2(v7) + N2 => N2(v6) + N2                !  kVT10_N2N2*7.266*exp(12.769d0/Tgas**(1.0d0/3.0d0))
N2(v8) + N2 => N2(v7) + N2                !  kVT10_N2N2*8.357*exp(14.897d0/Tgas**(1.0d0/3.0d0))

