# M. Capitelli, et al., Plasma Kinetics in Atmospheric Gases, Springer-Verlag, Berlin, Heidelberg, New York, 2000.
N2(v1) + N2(v1) => N2 + N2(v2)           ! kVV10_N2N2*2.012*exp(6.611d0/Tgas**0.5)*0.92
N2(v1) + N2(v2) => N2 + N2(v3)           ! kVV10_N2N2*3.037*exp(13.223d0/Tgas**0.5)*0.88
N2(v1) + N2(v3) => N2 + N2(v4)           ! kVV10_N2N2*4.075*exp(19.834d0/Tgas**0.5)*0.84
