N2(v1) + N2(v5) => N2 + N2(v6)           ! kVV10_N2N2*6.189*exp(33.057d0/Tgas**0.5)*0.76
N2(v1) + N2(v6) => N2 + N2(v7)           ! kVV10_N2N2*7.266*exp(39.668d0/Tgas**0.5)*0.72
N2(v1) + N2(v7) => N2 + N2(v8)           ! kVV10_N2N2*8.357*exp(46.279d0/Tgas**0.5)*0.68

